OL,3,GNEWSAMusic venue to reopen in 2027
OL,4,Aafter refurbishment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe O2 Academy Sheffield is set to
OL,7,Freopen in February 2027 following a
OL,8,Ffour-year closure for major
OL,9,Frefurbishment work.
OL,11,FThe music venue, which temporarily
OL,12,Fclosed in September 2023, will have a
OL,13,Fnew roof, air conditioning and a
OL,14,Fstate-of-the-art sound system,
OL,15,Forganisers said.
OL,17,FOriginally opened in 1968 as the Top
OL,18,FRank Suite, the Arundel Gate site has
OL,19,Fhosted gigs by artists including The
OL,20,FPolice, The Clash, Joy Division and
OL,21,FDavid Bowie over the last forty years.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
